## How to contact Rhythm Culture

First, choose the option that suits you best. Each one goes straight to our small team, so you’ll hear back from a real person.

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column %}
*Incursions & team building*

### Get a quick & easy quote

Planning an incursion or a team-building session? First, tell us your dates, location and group size. Then we’ll send you a tailored quote.

{% button label="Request a quote" href="/quick-quote/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}

{% column %}
*Ready to book*

### Book an incursion

Already know what you want? In that case, use our booking form to lock in your date, program and session times.

{% button label="Go to booking form" href="/booking-form/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}

{% column %}
*General enquiries*

### Ask a question

Got a general question about our programs, drums or events? Just send us a message, and we’ll reply as soon as we can.

{% button label="Send a message" href="/contact-form/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}

{% column %}
*Weekly classes*

### Join a class

New to drumming or Afro Dance Fitness? Your first 4 weeks cost just $50, so it’s easy to give it a try.

{% button label="See class times" href="/classes/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

